    "scenesThatPass": [
      "MANTICORE: This place used to be dangerous--\nCOSTUMED MANTICORE: Dangerous!\nMANTICORE: --and wild.\nCOSTUMED MANTICORE: Wild!",
      "MANTICORE: Last name \"Manticore.\" First name, \"The.\"\nLAUREL: Hold on! You're right, she has gone a little-- It's no wonder with a wound like that.",
      "LAUREL: Oh, I'm sorry, are you an expert on minotaurs?\nMANTICORE: Manticores.\nLAUREL: --Manticores?",
      "LAUREL: Well then you wouldn't know that when their blood is exposed to air, it makes them go bonkers.\nMANTICORE: I don't think that's true.\nLAUREL: See! She's already losing her grip on reality. So why don't you let me save her life before it costs you yours?",
      "GRECKLIN: There you are, one garlic crusher.\nMANTICORE: No, Curse Crusher. It's a large magical sword.\nGRECKLIN: Sword, sword, sword...\nGRECKLIN: I mean, I got this thing."
    ]
  },
